  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb pieces with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion to the pot and cook until it is softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, and cayenne pepper to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb to the pot and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the sherry vinegar, dates, and chicken broth to the pot.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Cook the tagine for 2.5 hours, or until the lamb is tender and the sauce is molten.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro."
